{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00577",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.47,
      "end_seconds": 10.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "The booking says you had a urine dipstick done at your check-up, and it showed something. What did they tell you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.13,
      "end_seconds": 24.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.39,
      "text": "Well, the nurse did it and said there was protein in it, or a trace, I think. I didn't really follow what that means."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.62,
      "end_seconds": 35.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Okay. Before we get to the dipstick, has anything about your waterworks seemed different to you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.6,
      "end_seconds": 49.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "Hmm. Now you mention it, there's been a lot of froth when I go. Like bubbles on top, a bit like washing-up liquid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.83,
      "end_seconds": 54.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Mm. Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.15,
      "end_seconds": 68.16,
      "duration_seconds": 13.01,
      "text": "It's in the loo, the bubbles, and they hang around a while before they go. I thought it was just the toilet cleaner at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.21,
      "end_seconds": 73.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "And how long have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.25,
      "end_seconds": 84.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "About three weeks, I'd say. Maybe a bit longer, but I only started really looking recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.91,
      "end_seconds": 93.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "Is it every time you pass water, or only now and then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.16,
      "end_seconds": 104.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Most mornings, first thing. Less so later in the day. It's not every single time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.62,
      "end_seconds": 114.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "I see. Anything else about the water itself? Colour, smell, how often you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.83,
      "end_seconds": 125.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "The colour's the usual straw sort of yellow. I go the normal amount, I think. Maybe once in the night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.67,
      "end_seconds": 129.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.29,
      "end_seconds": 142.53,
      "duration_seconds": 10.24,
      "text": "Is it the kidneys, doctor? I keep reading things on my phone and it's put the wind up me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.24,
      "end_seconds": 154.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "It's worth taking seriously, but froth by itself is very common and has plenty of causes. That's why we measure it properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.15,
      "end_seconds": 160.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How do you measure it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.4,
      "end_seconds": 175.28,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "With a urine sample sent to the lab. It gives an exact figure for how much protein is leaking, rather than a trace on a stick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.39,
      "end_seconds": 184.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Is that a different test from the one the nurse did?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.85,
      "end_seconds": 198.31,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "Yes, much more precise. The stick is a quick screen, and the lab test tells us what to make of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.13,
      "end_seconds": 204.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Okay. And what happens if it does show protein?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.58,
      "end_seconds": 214.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Then we'd plan the next step together. I don't want to guess before we have the number."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.66,
      "end_seconds": 218.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Fair enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.99,
      "end_seconds": 225.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Does anyone in the family have trouble with their kidneys?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.51,
      "end_seconds": 236.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "My dad did. He had kidney trouble in his sixties, and ended up seeing a specialist at the big hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.62,
      "end_seconds": 243.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I see. That's useful for me to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.91,
      "end_seconds": 253.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Oh dear. Does that make it more likely I've got it too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.88,
      "end_seconds": 265.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "It means we're careful, that's all. It's one more reason to do the proper test and not shrug it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.31,
      "end_seconds": 275.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Right. Should I be eating differently or drinking more water in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.45,
      "end_seconds": 284.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Drink as you normally would. No need to change anything until the results are in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.29,
      "end_seconds": 295.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "What about salt? My husband always says I put too much on my chips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.1,
      "end_seconds": 305.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Tell him to wait for the results too. We can talk about salt once we know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.84,
      "end_seconds": 316.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Anything else going on with your health that you wanted to mention while you're here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.49,
      "end_seconds": 326.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Not really. I had my gallbladder out about six years ago, but that was all sorted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.96,
      "end_seconds": 350.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Good to know. Let me just feel your tummy, if you'd lie back on the couch for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.09,
      "end_seconds": 361.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Your abdomen feels soft and comfortable all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.68,
      "end_seconds": 367.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "So that's all right then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.36,
      "end_seconds": 380.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.11,
      "text": "That part is. The answer will come from the urine test, so I'd like to arrange a urine protein test for you today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.4,
      "end_seconds": 390.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Do I need to do anything special, like fast or collect it all day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.95,
      "end_seconds": 402.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "Just a first morning sample, since that's when you see the froth. Take the pot home, bring it back to the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.02,
      "end_seconds": 411.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "I can do that. And I'll ring you if the froth changes, will I?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.76,
      "end_seconds": 423.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Do ring the surgery if anything worries you. Otherwise, we'll contact you once the result is in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 424.39,
      "end_seconds": 433.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Lovely, thank you for explaining it so clearly. I feel better for having come."
    }
  ]
}
